# Все запросы через gateway. Порядок как на показе: пользователи, справочники, мероприятие,
# брони, потом инфраструктура.

### Register admin (user-service)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@example.com", "fullName": "Admin", "role": "ADMIN"}

### Register organizer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "org@example.com", "fullName": "Organizer", "role": "ORGANIZER"}

### Register customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "user@example.com", "fullName": "Customer"}

### Who am I (user-service, reactive)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
X-User-Id: 3

### Users, page with X-Total-Count (admin = 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?page=0&size=10
X-User-Id: 1

### Create category (event-service asks user-service for the role)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Concerts"}

### Create tag (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tags
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Rock"}

### Create venue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/venues
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ice Palace", "city": "Saint Petersburg", "address": "Pr. Pyatiletok 1"}

### Create hall 5x10
POST http://localhost:8080/api/venues/1/halls
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Main", "rows": 5, "seatsPerRow": 10}

### Create event with tag (organizer = 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
X-User-Id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Rock night",
  "description": "Live show",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "hallId": 1,
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T19:00:00+03:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-01T22:00:00+03:00",
  "price": 1500.00,
  "tagIds": [1]
}

### Submit for moderation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/submit
X-User-Id: 2

### Publish (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/publish
X-User-Id: 1

### Catalogue, infinite scroll (hasNext, no total)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?city=Saint Petersburg&page=0&size=20

### Seat map (booking-service: hall from event-service, reservations from its own db)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/seats

### Book seats (customer = 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
X-User-Id: 3
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId": 1, "seatIds": [1, 2]}

### Same seat again: 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
X-User-Id: 3
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId": 1, "seatIds": [1]}

### My bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
X-User-Id: 3

### My tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
X-User-Id: 3

### Sales report (organizer)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/sales
X-User-Id: 2

### Cancel booking
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/cancel
X-User-Id: 3

### Cancel event: event-service flips the status, then asks booking-service to cancel bookings
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/cancel
X-User-Id: 2

### Cancel bookings by hand if booking-service was down during event cancel
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/bookings/cancel
X-User-Id: 2

### Size above 50 is capped
GET http://localhost:8080/api/halls/1/seats?size=500

### Swagger UI, one entry per service in the top-right list
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

### OpenAPI of a service through gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/booking-service/v3/api-docs

### Circuit breakers of event-service (state CLOSED / OPEN, failure rate)
GET http://localhost:8080/event-service/actuator/circuitbreakers

### Health of booking-service with circuit breaker details
GET http://localhost:8080/booking-service/actuator/health

### Config as event-service sees it
GET http://localhost:8888/event-service/default

### Eureka registry
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json
